[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15480.79, "timestamp": "04:18:00", "text": "乐趣。说实话，它能给你带来很多好处。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15482.87, "timestamp": "04:18:02", "text": "钱。就我个人而言，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15485.349, "timestamp": "04:18:05", "text": "首先是主播，然后是 YouTube 视频制作者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15487.67, "timestamp": "04:18:07", "text": "其次，因为我当时在剧院。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15489.269, "timestamp": "04:18:09", "text": "热爱现场娱乐。我爱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15490.55, "timestamp": "04:18:10", "text": "现场娱乐大众并获得"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15492.469, "timestamp": "04:18:12", "text": "聊天立刻刺激了多巴胺的分泌。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15495.349, "timestamp": "04:18:15", "text": "第一种，聊天型珍珠奶茶。伙计们，他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15496.95, "timestamp": "04:18:16", "text": "差点说出种族歧视的话。看看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15498.95, "timestamp": "04:18:18", "text": "他们打得真棒。正确的。真搞笑。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15500.95, "timestamp": "04:18:20", "text": "我真的很喜欢那种多巴胺带来的快感。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15503.429, "timestamp": "04:18:23", "text": "每次看到我的聊天记录是这样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15505.75, "timestamp": "04:18:25", "text": "快得惊人。这很棒。我拥有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15507.349, "timestamp": "04:18:27", "text": "轻轻一踢，这样我就可以同时完成这两个动作了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15509.75, "timestamp": "04:18:29", "text": "同时。我他妈太喜欢它了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15512.309, "timestamp": "04:18:32", "text": "这很棒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15514.55, "timestamp": "04:18:34", "text": "YouTube 直播、Twitch 直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15516.79, "timestamp": "04:18:36", "text": "直播、专属视频，它们不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15518.87, "timestamp": "04:18:38", "text": "去任何地方。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15521.07, "timestamp": "04:18:41", "text": "但问题就在这里。 YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15523.51, "timestamp": "04:18:43", "text": "集成。那么，YouTube 是什么呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15525.59, "timestamp": "04:18:45", "text": "一体化？嗯，YouTube 集成"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15530.95, "timestamp": "04:18:50", "text": "通常是90，或者大多数情况下是60到120。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15533.83, "timestamp": "04:18:53", "text": "第二个广告出现在开场一分钟内"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15536.95, "timestamp": "04:18:56", "text": "您的视频必须上传到指定位置。好的。现在，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15539.269, "timestamp": "04:18:59", "text": "这是很多创作者的面包和"}]